    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you beat The Dungeon Tower?</strong></h2><br>The 10 level of the tower await you in an epic journey full of monsters, traps, quests and relics. Increase your level and become the master hero required to beat the tower. You failed, no worries... the road is difficult but you get bravery points which allow you to get special power ups and try again. It's a roguelike which will grant you hours of fun fighting with the tower and reach the top to beat the Lord!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490750/extras/f583093eaeb80556778ea3a38d65fcfc.avif?t=1694433665\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you beat The Dungeon Tower?</strong></h2><br>The 10 level of the tower await you in an epic journey full of monsters, traps, quests and relics. Increase your level and become the master hero required to beat the tower. You failed, no worries... the road is difficult but you get bravery points which allow you to get special power ups and try again. It's a roguelike which will grant you hours of fun fighting with the tower and reach the top to beat the Lord!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490750/extras/f583093eaeb80556778ea3a38d65fcfc.avif?t=1694433665\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Can you beat The Dungeon Tower? A Fun roguelike where you can select one of the heroes to battle against the tower. Increase your level, gain new skills and complete quests to personalize your hero to kill the lord! Try and die in this journey until you can get stronger power ups to beat the game!",
